,"jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_15","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_16","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_17","text":"So, is making terrorists squad leaders, like, a tradition in Exotic or something?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_18","text":"Neon.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_19","text":"No, I'm honestly asking, because I really don't know.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_20","text":"The reason I was appointed the leader of the Exotic Squad is simple.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_21","text":"I know the Outer Rim better than anyone.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_22","text":"As for why I became a Nikke...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_23","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_24","text":"I wish to atone for what I've done.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_25","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_26","text":"I realize now how horrific terrorism is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_27","text":"Under the pretense of fighting for greater rights in the Outer Rim,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_28","text":"I was blinded by the belief I was undertaking a righteous mission,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_29","text":"fighting for the weak.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_30","text":"I brainwashed myself into thinking that for the cause, any means were justifiable, no matter how brutal.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_31","text":"... Ironically, it was being involved with terrorism that made me realize how foolish my thinking had been.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_32","text":"I've committed terrible,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_33","text":"unspeakable acts.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_34","text":"By the time I came to that realization, I was at death's door.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_35","text":"That's why I asked to be made into a Nikke.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_36","text":"Because I wanted to atone in any way possible.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_37","text":"And how exactly do you plan on doing that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_38","text":"By making sure nothing like this ever happens again.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_39","text":"By doing everything I can for those who were harmed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_40","text":"For how long?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_41","text":"Forever.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_42","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_43","text":"What about you, Viper?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_44","text":"Huh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_45","text":"How are you going to atone?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_46","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_47","text":"Aw, why you gotta be like that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_48","text":"Since I have to work with the people who caused such a major incident at the Ark,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_49","text":"I want to at least hear what your plan is moving forward.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_50","text":"You're the one who asked us for a favor, right? So you came here knowing exactly what you were getting into.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_51","text":"To be honest, it would have been way easier to ask the Underworld Queen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_52","text":"But still, I came to you. You wanna know why?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_53","text":"Because I wanted to see for myself what condition you all were in.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_54","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_55","text":"What if I were to say there's no particular reason?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_56","text":"Then I'll go back and can't help but keep looking at you with suspicion.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_57","text":"Honestly, I don't see you or anyone in Exotic in a good light. I'm sure Master, Rapi and Anis feel the same way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_58","text":"You stabbed us in the back up north, and you blasted a hole in the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_59","text":"And we took the brunt of the damage.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_60","text":"They say that you paid your dues, but if you ask me, I don't think the punishment was nearly harsh enough.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_61","text":"Then what kind of punishment would satisfy you, Neon?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_af_02_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_af_02_62","text":"The kind that never stops.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie